# You do NOT need a .env file. The audio script reads the ElevenLabs key from
# ~/.elevenlabs_key (a file in your home folder, outside this project), so the key
# can never be committed or uploaded with the project.
#
# Only if you prefer, copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in:
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your-elevenlabs-api-key
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=X5RWySWhCXiGdP9YIKck
# ELEVENLABS_MODEL=eleven_multilingual_v2
